Package: macbookair72-power
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: acpi-call-dkms, pciutils, python3, systemd
Maintainer: Unmaintained <noreply@example.invalid>
Description: Idle power fix for MacBookAir7,2 (Thunderbolt power-off + camera ASPM)
 Cuts power to the Thunderbolt controller through the Apple ACPI method and
 enables ASPM L1 on the FaceTime camera so the CPU package can reach deep
 C-states (pc6). Tested only on MacBookAir7,2 with Ubuntu 26.04. The
 Thunderbolt / Mini DisplayPort port is unpowered while the fix is active.
